OTP_SUPL_CO_CODE^OTP공급회사코드^3^0^0^0^0^0^0
OTP_STAT_CLS_CODE^OTP상태구분코드^3^0^0^0^0^0^0
RQST_STA_STTN_NO^요청시작위치번호^3^0^0^0^0^0^0
TLMS_PROS_DATE^전문처리일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
OTP_TLMS_SRNO^OTP전문일련번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
APRV_YN^승인 여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" occurs="10" inout="out" _len="336" _ulen="272" >

OTP_ISNC_ISTU_CODE^OTP 발급 기관 코드^5^0^0^0^0^0^0
OTP_UTLZ_REG_DATE^OTP 이용 등록 일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
